#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:2
msgid "VM Advanced Options"
msgstr "Options avancées de la VM"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:4
msgid ""
"When provisioning or reconfiguring HVM virtual machines, the **Advanced "
"Options** section provides controls for firmware, boot behavior, "
"security, graphics, and virtualization settings. These options are found "
"on the CONFIGURE tab during provisioning or through the "
":guilabel:`Actions` > :guilabel:`Reconfigure` menu on an existing VM."
msgstr ""
"Lors du provisionnement ou de la reconfiguration de machines virtuelles HVM, "
"la section **Options avancées** fournit des contrôles pour le micrologiciel, "
"le comportement de démarrage, la sécurité, les graphiques et les paramètres "
"de virtualisation. Ces options se trouvent dans l'onglet CONFIGURE pendant le "
"provisionnement ou via le menu :guilabel:`Actions` > :guilabel:`Reconfigure` "
"sur une VM existante."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:6
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Note"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:6
msgid ""
"Some options are only available at initial provisioning, and some are "
"only available during reconfigure. See the availability notes for each "
"option below. Changing firmware or boot options on an existing VM "
"typically requires the VM to be powered off and its configuration "
"regenerated."
msgstr ""
"Certaines options ne sont disponibles que lors du provisionnement initial, "
"et d'autres uniquement lors de la reconfiguration. Consultez les notes de "
"disponibilité pour chaque option ci-dessous. La modification des options de "
"micrologiciel ou de démarrage sur une VM existante nécessite généralement "
"que la VM soit éteinte et que sa configuration soit régénérée."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:9
msgid "Hardware / Chipset"
msgstr "Matériel / Chipset"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/hvm/vm_advanced_options.rst:15
